    "_resource_note": "PE snap_assets is already-counted liquid resources. Carry this yearly stock without monthly division into the valuation input actually used by total_household_resources_before_exclusions. The separate cash_on_hand enumeration is not read by the bound resource chain and stays zero; do not double-count the aggregate. Other resource components and exclusions remain zero because PE supplies the counted aggregate. Categorical exemption continues to follow meets_snap_categorical_eligibility.",
    "_utility_note": "Each utility-cost fact is PE's yearly expense above zero (pre-subsidy electricity, as PE's own utility count uses, to avoid the subsidy's SNAP dependence). Heating or cooling is has_heating_cooling_expense. LEAP receipt: PE's always-SUA parameter marks the Heat-and-Eat states (CO among them) where every SNAP household is deemed to receive the nominal energy payment; the composition reads that as LEAP or E-EBT receipt, which is the same presumption stated as a fact."
